      "writtenOn": "2023-11-17T18:57:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Currently Buffers don\u0027t ever get CB refs. The command buffer always takes a usage ref to them. Though I could see adding CB refs instead on non-mappable buffers (i.e. GPU only buffers). At that point they\u0027re not much different from a textures where access is already ordered by the command buffers.\n\nOn a high level reuse/caching of Resources is basically all controlled by the UsageRef. So it is the UsageRef going to zero that sends a Resource back to the cache where it can be reused. CB refs really only keep the object alive.",
